 the radial artery. Importance of microsurgery. Apropos of a case</article-title><source>Ann Chir Main</source><year>1982</year><volume>1</volume><fpage>40</fpage><lpage>44</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9303041</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0753-9053(82)80041-0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>AA</given-names></name><name><surname>Strauch</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Moore</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Pseudoaneurysm of the ulnar artery occurring after fracture of the distal radius and ulna: a case report</article-title><source>J Hand Surg [Am]</source><year>1998</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>933</fpage><lpage>937</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9763275</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0363-5023(98)80176-7</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dhal</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Chadha</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Lal</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Singh</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Tyagi</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Encounters with pseudoaneurysms in orthopaedic practice</article-title><source>Injury</source><year>2001</year><volume>32</volume><fpage>771</fpage><lpage>778</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11754884</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0020-1383(01)00094-8</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zitsman</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Pseudoaneurysm after penetrating trauma in children and adolescents</article-title><source>J Pediatr Surg</source><year>1998</year><volume>33</volume><fpage>1574</fpage><lpage>1577</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9802820</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0022-3468(98)90504-8</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Votapka</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Backer</surname><given-names>Cl</given-names></name><name><surname>Mavroudis</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Giant popliteal false aneurysm in an 8-year-old child</article-title><source>J Pediatr Surg</source><year>1993</year><volume>28</volume><fpage>1594</fpage><lpage>1596</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8301504</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0022-3468(93)90110-7</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>